OL,3,GNEWSACounty Hall plans will 'reduce
OL,4,Acosts for taxpayer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Derbyshire County Council
OL,7,Fhas said an #130m plan to convert the
OL,8,Forganisation's headquarters into a
OL,9,Fhotel and new homes will "reduce costs
OL,10,Ffor the taxpayer in the long term".
OL,12,FDerbyshire Dales District Council's
OL,13,Fplanning committee has been recommended
OL,14,Fto approve plans to revamp the Grade
OL,15,FII-listed County Hall in Matlock -
OL,16,Fotherwise known as Smedley's Hydro -
OL,17,Fwhen it meets on Tuesday.
OL,19,FThe proposed redevelopment would also
OL,20,Finclude the restoration of the Winter
OL,21,FGardens.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
