OL,3,GNEWSACounty Hall plans will 'reduce
OL,4,Acosts for taxpayer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlan Graves, leader of Reform UK-led
OL,7,Fcounty council, told the BBC the
OL,8,Fbuilding was in "desperate need of
OL,9,Frepair" and was costing the council
OL,10,F"many millions of pounds every year to
OL,11,Fwork inside it".
